Determine the transfer function of the system having the following state variable representation:
<br>$$\eqalign{
  &amp; X = \left[ {\matrix{
   0 &amp; 1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1  \cr 
   { - 40} &amp; { - 44} &amp; { - 14}  \cr 

 } } \right]x + \left[ {\matrix{
   0  \cr 
   1  \cr 
   0  \cr 

 } } \right]u  \cr 
  &amp; y = \left[ {\matrix{
   0 &amp; 1 &amp; 0  \cr 

 } } \right]x \cr} $$

Express the given matrix $$A = \left[ {\matrix{
   2 &amp; 1 &amp; 5  \cr 
   4 &amp; 8 &amp; {13}  \cr 
   6 &amp; {27} &amp; {31}  \cr 

 } } \right]$$
<br>as a product of triangular matrices $$L$$ and $$U$$ where the diagonal elements of the lower triangular matrices $$L$$ are unity and $$U$$ is an upper triangular matrix.
